  "details": "Right now if you add interact to an udonbehaviour, it permanently becomes interactable. This is annoying if you want to make a general purpose script for all your basic stuff like interact, onentertrigger, etc. Unless you want your onentertriggers to have an interact outline that does nothing, You have to split it up so that one script handles interact and another script handles everything else",
